WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

01:33.060 --> 01:34.190
Let's go, Hiro!

01:34.190 --> 01:35.420
What happened, Liza?

01:35.420 --> 01:37.400
Hime's being attacked!

01:37.590 --> 01:39.570
Down by the pond!

02:01.580 --> 02:03.080
You're late, Liza.

02:03.090 --> 02:05.190
I'm not one of your servants!

02:05.420 --> 02:07.060
Liza?

02:11.830 --> 02:13.640
She escaped.

02:13.860 --> 02:15.230
Damn it!

02:15.230 --> 02:17.210
Another weakling?

02:17.400 --> 02:19.040
Liza?

02:31.550 --> 02:36.220
Liza's been so gloomy lately.
I wonder why?

02:36.220 --> 02:38.660
There's no need to be in such a rush, either.

02:41.090 --> 02:45.730
As long as she's with me, there's a
chance we'll encounter them.

02:45.730 --> 02:48.700
Liza's enemy will come after me.

02:48.700 --> 02:52.410
She just needs to sharpen her claws
and wait for that day to come.

02:56.710 --> 02:58.690
This won't do.

02:59.940 --> 03:01.410
Hiro!

03:01.410 --> 03:03.390
She's calling you, Hiro.

03:05.710 --> 03:07.920
Don't let yourself be beaten so easily!

03:07.920 --> 03:10.190
You say that, but...

03:10.420 --> 03:12.690
I need a new sparring partner.

03:12.690 --> 03:15.220
Isn't there someone tougher than you?!

03:15.220 --> 03:16.620
Tougher?

03:16.630 --> 03:19.330
Someone skilled, with lots of power.

03:21.000 --> 03:22.500
What about Flandre?

03:22.500 --> 03:25.600
She's strong but she's not able to spar.

03:25.830 --> 03:28.040
Then, what about Francesca?

03:28.040 --> 03:33.150
Do you really think I'd bow down to
Princess Sherwood and ask to borrow her?

03:35.580 --> 03:39.450
If you want me to loan you Francesca,
prostrate yourself before me.

03:39.450 --> 03:40.110
Huga.

03:41.680 --> 03:44.590
Th..Then, what about Reiri?

03:44.590 --> 03:47.070
Reiri?

03:48.420 --> 03:52.560
Oh dear, someone must be talking about me.

03:52.560 --> 03:55.630
Being so charming has its downside.

03:56.360 --> 04:01.750
A vampire is out, out, out, out,
out, out of the question!

04:02.870 --> 04:06.750
Maybe there is no one who would be
able to spar with you.

04:07.780 --> 04:09.590
There is!

04:16.620 --> 04:19.000
My sparring partner is here.

04:20.620 --> 04:22.320
By the way,

04:22.320 --> 04:24.660
why did you all follow me here?!

04:24.660 --> 04:26.160
Don't worry about it.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.800
Huga.

04:28.860 --> 04:30.160
And also...

04:30.170 --> 04:35.640
Welcome, welcome, Princess!

04:37.840 --> 04:39.440
Liza!

04:39.440 --> 04:41.710
I missed you!

04:41.710 --> 04:43.520
I hate you!

04:48.280 --> 04:52.950
Welcome back, Princess.

04:52.950 --> 04:57.950
We Fishmen polished our scales and waited
with bated breath for your return.

05:02.300 --> 05:05.300
Looks like you rebuilt the villa that collapsed.

05:05.300 --> 05:10.440
Yes, we completed the construction
quite magnificently.

05:19.950 --> 05:22.050
That hurts!

05:22.050 --> 05:24.530
It hurts a lot!

05:25.590 --> 05:28.590
Fight me for real! For real!

05:28.590 --> 05:30.390
Oh, but I am.

05:30.390 --> 05:32.200
Ay, ay-

05:32.960 --> 05:36.030
What the hell is "Ay", you useless fish?!

05:52.310 --> 05:53.610
What is this?

05:53.620 --> 05:55.850
Do you like it?

05:55.850 --> 06:00.960
It's a premium item which I put every essence
of my being into making.

06:01.660 --> 06:05.230
Let me show you the cellar next.

06:05.230 --> 06:06.260
Cellar?

06:06.260 --> 06:10.030
Yes, I'm certain you will find it to your liking.

06:10.030 --> 06:15.000
It's kept at a humidity of eighty percent,
so as to stay soggy and comfortable for...

06:16.710 --> 06:18.340
Princess?

06:18.940 --> 06:20.110
What?

06:20.110 --> 06:21.920
Never mind...

06:26.980 --> 06:30.020
Geez, you won't beat me!

06:33.290 --> 06:38.400
Rain for me, Liza.

06:46.640 --> 06:48.170
Someone from the shark race?

06:51.610 --> 06:56.420
What's someone from the shark race,
known for being assassins, doing here?

07:00.650 --> 07:03.390
You wanna race me? Sounds like fun!

07:15.600 --> 07:17.410
Not bad!

07:27.940 --> 07:29.750
Damn you...

07:37.120 --> 07:43.090
D..Don't you find this wonderful
humidity to your liking?

07:53.400 --> 07:55.040
Huga.

07:59.410 --> 08:01.050
What?!

08:04.250 --> 08:07.280
Th..This is bad!

08:19.060 --> 08:20.800
Liza!

08:23.300 --> 08:29.610
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

08:31.870 --> 08:35.880
Liza! Where are you?

08:35.880 --> 08:40.880
All of you! Hurry and find the princess's friend!

08:41.080 --> 08:43.020
Yes, sir!

08:43.020 --> 08:44.660
Huga.

09:01.140 --> 09:04.640
You don't look to be hurt. You're strong.

09:04.640 --> 09:09.110
Do not be alarmed.
I'm only into married women.

09:13.110 --> 09:16.720
You look like him, Liza.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.490
Liza Wildman...

09:18.950 --> 09:21.190
I knew it was you.

09:21.190 --> 09:25.730
I was a good friend of your older brother,
Lobo Wildman.

09:25.730 --> 09:27.490
My brother?

09:27.500 --> 09:30.360
My name's Aron, nice to meet you.

09:30.370 --> 09:32.000
Y..Yeah...

09:38.110 --> 09:42.510
Okay, eat as much as you'd like, Sherwood.

09:42.510 --> 09:45.410
I was called over for a dinner party,
but it's just me.

09:45.410 --> 09:47.820
What gives?

09:47.820 --> 09:50.320
Oh, but Ryu is here, too.

09:50.320 --> 09:52.320
Isn't Hiro around?

09:52.320 --> 09:54.930
That jerk, some servant of mine.

09:55.360 --> 10:00.290
The Mistress, Hiro, and Liza
all went out somewhere.

10:00.300 --> 10:04.300
But since I made a ton of food, like usual,

10:04.300 --> 10:05.930
feel free to eat it all.

10:05.930 --> 10:08.040
I don't need all this!

10:09.900 --> 10:12.110
But all right...

10:12.110 --> 10:15.250
Since you went to the trouble of making it,
I'll partake.

10:19.780 --> 10:21.250
It's delicious!

10:21.250 --> 10:23.290
There's dessert, too.

10:24.750 --> 10:26.390
Huga.

10:40.140 --> 10:43.880
Liza! Where have you run off to?

10:49.280 --> 10:51.090
You aren't going to eat?

10:52.580 --> 10:54.560
Where did you meet my brother?

10:55.450 --> 10:56.920
In the army.

10:56.920 --> 10:57.950
The army?

10:57.950 --> 11:02.950
Even though I was from the hated race
of assassins, the shark race,

11:03.090 --> 11:05.990
he didn't discriminate against me.

11:05.990 --> 11:07.970
He was a kind soul.

11:08.930 --> 11:11.710
Did you ask him about me, too?

11:12.300 --> 11:13.940
Yeah...

11:24.650 --> 11:27.720
She's not my type, but she's still cute.

11:28.750 --> 11:30.700
Flattery won't get you very far.

11:31.750 --> 11:33.730
You too were close, huh?

11:34.190 --> 11:36.690
We fought all the time, though.

11:36.690 --> 11:39.290
That's proof that you two were close.

11:39.290 --> 11:44.290
I was drafted to be in the Royal Guard of another
noble, so I haven't seen him in a long time.

11:45.630 --> 11:47.610
Is he doing well?

11:49.640 --> 11:51.540
What's wrong?

11:51.540 --> 11:52.940
My brother...

11:52.940 --> 11:54.580
Liza?

11:55.240 --> 11:56.880
He...

12:00.220 --> 12:02.280
I see.

12:02.280 --> 12:04.650
I don't know which member
of the Royal Family did it,

12:04.650 --> 12:08.660
but someone used me as bait to lure him out.

12:08.660 --> 12:11.640
Lobo bared his fangs at his master?

12:12.060 --> 12:17.100
I'm sure he didn't intend to killing the princess.

12:20.130 --> 12:24.440
He planned all along on being
defeated by the princess.

12:24.440 --> 12:27.980
A soldier treasures his master's life over all others.

12:28.410 --> 12:30.220
He was...

12:30.880 --> 12:32.950
...a true knight.

12:33.580 --> 12:36.290
Be proud, Liza.

12:38.720 --> 12:41.360
He died because of me...

12:43.090 --> 12:45.090
Don't cry, Liza.

12:45.090 --> 12:48.730
He truly cared about you.

12:48.730 --> 12:50.430
It's just like him.

12:50.430 --> 12:52.630
You should be proud, Liza.

12:52.630 --> 12:54.440
Your brother was an honorable man.

13:03.080 --> 13:05.180
There, that's better.

13:10.150 --> 13:11.920
Liza!

13:11.920 --> 13:12.990
Poseidon!

13:12.990 --> 13:14.490
I'm so glad you're okay!

13:21.300 --> 13:24.000
Hime, they found Liza.

13:26.530 --> 13:29.870
Well, that's just wonderful.

13:29.870 --> 13:31.440
Isn't that great, Hime?

13:32.470 --> 13:33.470
Huga.

13:33.470 --> 13:35.340
Where is she, then?

13:35.340 --> 13:37.250
She's with Poseidon.

13:37.880 --> 13:41.880
She was trying to cheer herself up.

13:42.420 --> 13:45.150
I can't take it any more.

13:45.150 --> 13:48.430
Why did it have to end up this way?

13:51.360 --> 13:53.860
What's wrong? Done already?

13:53.860 --> 13:55.670
No friggin' way!

13:57.970 --> 13:59.780
Damn it!

14:04.310 --> 14:06.510
You've got guts.

14:06.510 --> 14:08.490
You probably learned that from your brother.

14:10.480 --> 14:14.410
You can still get stronger, just like Lobo.

14:14.420 --> 14:16.750
Like my brother?

14:16.750 --> 14:19.660
That's right. That's right! Okay!

14:29.530 --> 14:31.100
I'm glad we met.

14:31.100 --> 14:33.840
Liza, for Lobo as well...

14:34.870 --> 14:36.510
Nah...

14:39.610 --> 14:43.080
I..l thought you were only into married women!

14:43.850 --> 14:45.830
I was just saying goodbye.

14:48.250 --> 14:49.880
Will I see you again?

14:49.880 --> 14:51.550
We'll see.

14:51.550 --> 14:53.590
You can see me again!

14:53.590 --> 14:55.400
Not likely!

14:55.720 --> 14:57.530
Oh, we'll meet again.

15:03.530 --> 15:05.340
I'm sure.

15:06.130 --> 15:08.370
Ready, and go!

15:08.370 --> 15:13.110
Liza, come back!

15:13.840 --> 15:15.950
Here you go, Mistress.

15:23.120 --> 15:24.750
Thank you very much.

15:24.750 --> 15:29.750
You've been really energetic since we've
come back from the lake, Liza.

15:29.860 --> 15:33.570
Someone told me I can get strong,
like my brother.

15:34.030 --> 15:37.130
Oh, what do we have here, a doggy-back ride?

15:38.070 --> 15:39.270
Reiri!

15:39.270 --> 15:42.840
Being on all fours is definitely
appropriate for a dog.

15:42.840 --> 15:44.840
You damn vampire!

15:44.840 --> 15:47.570
Oh? Do you want to fight me?

15:47.580 --> 15:50.710
I'd love to. Let's do this!

15:50.710 --> 15:52.520
Sounds good to me.

15:53.410 --> 15:55.080
I won't go easy on you.

15:55.080 --> 15:56.120
Bring it!

15:56.120 --> 15:58.560
Umm, you two...

16:00.220 --> 16:02.020
Quite the ruckus.

16:02.020 --> 16:04.290
I wonder what's going on?

16:04.290 --> 16:07.360
I'd wager that Reiri's here.

16:07.360 --> 16:09.600
Oh, Reiri's here?

16:09.600 --> 16:12.600
I'll go make her some English tea, then.

16:12.830 --> 16:17.280
It seems that Liza has gotten over her
gloomy spell quite well.

16:40.030 --> 16:42.530
It's the same assassin as the other day.

16:45.270 --> 16:47.250
Princess, prepare yourself.

16:56.140 --> 16:58.350
You're pretty skilled.

16:59.080 --> 17:01.390
Which one of my siblings sent you?

17:04.420 --> 17:07.370
I suppose I shouldn't expect an answer to that.

17:09.560 --> 17:11.200
Hime!

17:12.160 --> 17:13.790
You're late, Liza.

17:13.790 --> 17:16.730
I told you that I'm not one of your servants!

17:16.730 --> 17:19.640
Come on! You've gotta get through me!

17:23.040 --> 17:24.680
Aron?

17:29.240 --> 17:30.880
Stop!

17:39.790 --> 17:40.950
Hime!

17:40.960 --> 17:42.760
You're late.

17:55.940 --> 17:58.040
That's all you've got?

17:58.040 --> 18:04.180
You're trying to protect royalty and defeat
your enemies at that level?

18:05.310 --> 18:07.810
But why would you...

18:07.820 --> 18:11.490
I told you, I'm in the Royal Guard.

18:12.250 --> 18:15.000
I was ordered to kill Hime.

18:17.230 --> 18:19.030
Why won't you fight back?

18:19.030 --> 18:20.840
Stop this, Aron!

18:21.360 --> 18:23.760
Orders from my master are ultimate.

18:23.760 --> 18:25.570
If you won't fight me,

18:25.830 --> 18:27.970
then I'll have to kill you.

18:27.970 --> 18:29.710
And then I'll kill the princess!

18:30.810 --> 18:32.440
Aron...

18:32.440 --> 18:35.080
What are you fighting for?

18:37.750 --> 18:39.380
Liza!

18:40.110 --> 18:42.150
Answer me, Liza!

18:43.220 --> 18:45.560
I fight because...

18:47.220 --> 18:49.830
Be proud, Liza.

18:50.560 --> 18:54.460
I fight because... because...

18:54.460 --> 18:57.170
I want to get vengeance for my brother!

19:08.780 --> 19:10.410
Liza!

19:14.420 --> 19:16.050
Aron...

19:28.560 --> 19:31.900
Don't forget that thought.

19:31.900 --> 19:34.780
Aron, why? Why?

19:35.300 --> 19:38.570
Orders from my master are ultimate.

19:38.570 --> 19:40.010
Aron...

19:40.010 --> 19:42.340
This is fine.

19:42.340 --> 19:44.150
This is fate.

19:45.350 --> 19:48.290
It's the destiny of one who serves
the Royal Family.

19:48.520 --> 19:50.550
Liza, take this.

19:53.520 --> 19:55.330
What is it?

20:02.130 --> 20:04.800
So, you've elected to join the Royal Guard.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.610
Very impressive.

20:06.770 --> 20:09.540
Your sister must be delighted.

20:09.540 --> 20:13.920
Maybe now I've become a big brother
that she can be proud to have.

20:15.080 --> 20:18.750
So, I guess we're going to be apart for a while

20:18.750 --> 20:20.730
I'll miss you.

20:23.180 --> 20:25.930
Aron, take this.

20:27.560 --> 20:33.130
I don't have any use for it now.
I want you to have it.

20:37.600 --> 20:39.240
Lobo...

20:41.270 --> 20:42.910
Please...

20:45.770 --> 20:47.410
Okay...

20:49.210 --> 20:53.120
Get his vengeance for me as well.

20:55.520 --> 20:59.970
You can still get much, much stronger.

21:04.790 --> 21:06.430
Lobo...

21:11.200 --> 21:13.610
Hey, Aron... Aron!

21:14.400 --> 21:16.180
Aron!

21:24.150 --> 21:25.950
Damn it...

21:27.720 --> 21:30.160
Screw this fight for the throne.

21:31.290 --> 21:34.160
Go to hell!

21:40.490 --> 21:42.770
It slips my mind from time to time:

21:44.030 --> 21:48.340
the fact that Hime is perpetually
in the midst of war.

21:48.900 --> 21:52.940
And that I'm with her.

21:52.940 --> 21:54.750
And Liza, too.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.420
Huga.

23:42.420 --> 23:44.820
Look, I've got a pimple.

23:44.820 --> 23:46.450
That means someone is thinking about me!

23:46.450 --> 23:48.020
I wonder who?!

23:48.020 --> 23:49.060
Huga.

23:49.060 --> 23:51.820
You don't have to worry about me, Flandre.

23:51.830 --> 23:53.290
You've got it good, Flandre.

23:53.290 --> 23:55.700
You don't have to worry about pimples,
blotches, or wrinkles.

23:55.700 --> 23:56.860
Huga.

23:56.860 --> 23:58.400
Next episode, "Princess Maturation"

23:58.400 --> 23:59.930
We learn something new about monsters.

23:59.930 --> 24:01.100
Did you know, Flandre?

24:01.100 --> 24:04.370
In the Edo period, a woman was considered
over-the-hill at twenty!

24:04.370 --> 24:07.470
Hiro, you trying to say something about me?

24:07.470 --> 24:07.940
No! Not a thing!

24:09.440 --> 24:10.790
Huga, huga.
